---------------------+----+/-! ## Computational verification -/
---------------------+----+
---------------------+----+/-- Verified: for all n ∈ [13, 10000], either n is prime or primPart n > 1 -/
---------------------+----+theorem primPart_check : ∀ n ∈ Finset.Icc 13 10000, Nat.Prime n ∨ 1 < primPart n := by
---------------------+----+  native_decide
