-----+---+----+--+       with F(m). Since Q ≈ φ^{m(p-1)} >> p for n > 10000,
-----+---+----+--+       the coprime part of F(n) w.r.t. all proper-divisor Fibonacci numbers
-----+---+----+--+       is > 1, yielding a primitive prime divisor.
