-------+--+--+-+  · -- Infinite tail: composite n > 10000
-------+--+--+-+    /- **Carmichael's theorem (1913), infinite tail.**
-------+--+--+-+       For composite n > 10000, primPart n > 1.
-------+--+--+-+
-------+--+--+-+       **Proof outline using the Fibonacci LTE (fib_lifting_the_exponent):**
