-+-+---+--+/-! # Complete proof of Carmichael's theorem (composite case)
-+-+--++--+       **Proof outline using the Fibonacci LTE (fib_lifting_the_exponent):**
-+-+--++--+       For composite n, let p be its smallest prime factor, m = n/p.
